      "text": "my covenant … Every man child among you shall be circumcised, Gen. 17:10. circumcised the flesh of their foreskin, Gen. 17:23. circumcised his son Isaac being eight days old, Gen. 21:4 (Acts 7:8). every male of you be circumcised, Gen. 34:15. bloody husband thou art, because of the circumcision, Ex. 4:26. when a stranger … keep the passover … be circumcised, Ex. 12:48. eighth day the … foreskin shall be circumcised, Lev. 12:3. circumcise again the children of Israel, Josh. 5:2. punish all them which are circumcised, Jer. 9:25. No stranger, uncircumcised … shall enter into my sanctuary, Ezek. 44:9.",
